2 CONT
2 CONT Johannes Jacobsen Aabo (aka Jacobson) was the son of Jakob Johannesson Aabo and Asgjerd Klausdatter Aabo.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Barbra Olsdatter Teig on October 4, 1847, at Sauda, Rogaland, Norway. The children to this union are listed on her Find a Grave memorial.
