2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/166749282/barbra_jacobson
2 CONT
2 CONT Barbra Olsdatter Teig (aka Olsen) was the daughter of Ole Knutson Teig (1799-1892, Norway) and Gunnhild Pålsdtr Ytre Birkeland (1801-1890, Norway) [Ref. Sauda Book page 313]
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Johannes Jakobsen on Oct. 4, 1847, at Sauda, Rogaland, Norway. To this union the following children are known:
2 CONT - Jakob Johannesen Abo (1848-1852)
2 CONT - Ole J. Johannesson Abo (aka Jacobson) (1850-1939)
2 CONT - Jacob Johannesson Jacobson Abo (1853-1877)
2 CONT - Asjer Johannesdatter Abo (aka Jacobson)(1855-1928)
2 CONT - Knute Johanneson Jacobson (1858-1943)
2 CONT - Thore Johannesson Abo (1860-1941)
2 CONT - Gunhild Johannessdatter Jacobson (1863-1954)
2 CONT - Ellen J. Jacobson (Mrs. Ole Halverson)(20 May 1866-29 May 1953)
2 CONT - Bertha Johanna Jacobson (Mrs. Kurt G. Amdahl)(1869-1 Nov 1945)
2 CONT
2 CONT Johannes and Barbra were members of the Bergen Lutheran Church, Roland, Iowa.
