3 CONT
3 CONT I really don't know the exact year. Could be 1897, because of Willa Thane's age. Ca. 24 years old - so must be ca. 1897. 
3 CONT But; who is the old man in the middle. Grandfather Lars Michael Thane - the pastry chef looks so much like him. But he passed away in 1881...
2 NOTE Amazing photograph!! Thank you for sharing. I don’t see my grandfather Lars Thane in this photo but perhaps he had already emigrated to the USA. Tiffanie Thane Henderson
