2 CONT <p style="text-align: left;" dir="ltr">Ref. Gard og &AElig;tt i Sola:&nbsp;Gimra, side 76, bruk 2, huslyd 1. F&oslash;dt p&aring;&nbsp;Gimra i Haaland,&nbsp;side ???, bruk 1, huslyd 9,4. 6 barn. (Nils-Rune Kolnes, Mar 2014)</p>
