2 CONT
2 CONT Barbara Renee Brown Daffer
2 CONT BIRTH	15 May 1939
2 CONT Provo, Utah County, Utah, USA
2 CONT DEATH	14 Jan 2017 (aged 77)
2 CONT Circleville, Piute County, Utah, USA
2 CONT BURIAL	
2 CONT Circleville Cemetery
2 CONT Circleville, Piute County, Utah, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Renee Daffer
2 CONT
2 CONT Circleville, Utah
2 CONT
2 CONT Barbara Renee Brown Daffer age 77 died Saturday January 14th, 2017 in Circleville, Utah. She was born May 15th 1939 in Provo, Utah to Lloyd H. Brown and Genene Young. Renee took great pride in her family and friends.
2 CONT
2 CONT Renee was preceded in death by her parents, sister Jeanette and son Chad. She is survived by her sister Bette Kay (Hartman) Daniels, children Wayne (Yolanda) Tunheim, Jayne Glass, Kelly (Anna) Daffer, and Mark Tunheim. Grandkids a
2 CONC nd great grandkids include Kristina, Kolden, Kassandra, Kara, Sara, Hannah, Luke, Brooklyn, Emberly, and AJ.
2 CONT
2 CONT Services will be held Saturday, January 21st at 12 pm at the Circleville LDS church. Arrangements made with Mosdell Mortuary of Kanab, Utah.
2 CONT Published in The Spectrum & Daily News on Jan. 19, 2017
