1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/10213138/joann-pierson
2 CONT
2 CONT JoAnn Ferrara Pierson
2 CONT BIRTH	31 May 1943
2 CONT Modesto, Stanislaus County, California, USA
2 CONT DEATH	26 Jan 1993 (aged 49)
2 CONT Modesto, Stanislaus County, California, USA
2 CONT BURIAL	
2 CONT Saint Stanislaus Catholic Cemetery
2 CONT Modesto, Stanislaus County, California, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Rosanna, Jeanette, and Dawn. One Time Wife of Donald Pierson (1943-1993). Daughter of Vincent "Jim" Ferrara (1898-1975), and Gaetana "Anna" Ferrara (1906-1993). Died of Cancer Age 49.
2 CONT
2 CONT JoAnn Pierson May 31, 1943 --_Jan. 26, 1993
2 CONT
2 CONT JoAnn Pierson , 49, of Modesto died Tuesday at Scenic Circle Care Center.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Pierson was a lifelong resident of Modesto. She was a nurses assistant at Casa de Modesto Convalescent Hospital and a member of St. Joseph's Catholic Church. She graduated from Thomas Downey High School in 1961.
2 CONT
2 CONT She is survived by her children, Rosanna Pierson , Jeanette Ward and Dawn Pierson , all of Modesto; mother, Anna Ferrara of Modesto; a brother, Jim Farrara of Modesto; a sister, Carolyn Hughes of Oakland; and one grandchild.
2 CONT
2 CONT The rosary will be recited at 7 p.m. today at Salas Brothers Funeral Chapel. A_Mass will be said at 9:30 a.m. Thursday at St. Joseph's Catholic Church. Burial will follow at St. Stanislaus Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Remembrances may be made to Community Hospice, 601_McHenry Ave., Suite C, Modesto 95350.
2 CONT
