1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Bartolomeus Burchardt Feser (Bertel Feser) was born in Bremen (Germany) on February 22, 1764. He moved to Bergen (Norway) where he was a "Blickenschlagermester" He died in Bergen on Februari 27, 1814. He was marrie
