2 CONT # Lars, dpt. 20-12-1742, g. m. Maren Pedersdtr. Gjersdal, br. 5.
2 CONT # Ingeborg, dpt. 7-8-1744, sk. 9-11-1774, ug.
2 CONT # Ingrid, dpt. 11-12-1746, bodde i Holland.
