2 GIVN Ågot Nilsdatter
2 SURN Haukland
2 _MARNM Kjellesvig
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1693
2 PLAC Haukland
2 ADDR
3 STAE Rogaland
3 CTRY Norway
1 DEAT
2 DATE MAR 1774
