2 DATE 27 AUG 1860
2 PLAC Njølstad
2 ADDR
3 CITY Hå
3 STAE Rogaland
3 CTRY Norway
1 BAPM
2 DATE 16 SEP 1860
2 ADDR
3 CITY Nærbø
