2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Born - 18 Aug 1881 Froyland, Time, Rogaland, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT             Died -  8 Aug 1967 Mary GreeleyHosp, Ames, Story Co., IA
2 CONT
2 CONT             Bur. - 11 Aug 1967 Palestine Cem., Huxley, Story Co., IA
2 CONT
2 CONT             Note - Andrew was born near Froylandsvatnet (Froyland Lake) in Time.  He arrived from 
2 CONT
2 CONT                    Norway with his mother (Marie Bryne Froyland) and   sisters and    brothers 
2 CONT
2 CONT                    in 1888 (or 1889).  Arrived in thunderstorm at train depot in Sheldahl, IA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT                    They may have left Norway on 17 MAY 1888.
2 CONT
2 CONT                    Andrew farmed his entire life near Cambridge, IA. 
2 CONT
