1 NOTE {geni:about_me} To America 1858.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/115550519/oscar-thompson
2 CONT
2 CONT Aslak "Oscar" Thompson immigrated to the United States from Norway in 1858.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Ragnhild Jacobson on Nov. 9, 1858, in Kendall County, Ill.
2 CONT
2 CONT He became a naturalized citizen on Jan. 18, 1890.
2 CONT
2 CONT Known children:
2 CONT 1) Anna Thompson (1859-1878)
2 CONT 2) Allis "Alice" Thompson (Mrs. John Nerem)(28 May 1861-20 May 1944)
2 CONT 3) Thea Thompson (Mrs. John Halverson) (17 Sep 1863-22 Aug 1941) FAG# 58212301
2 CONT 4) Julia Thompson (Mrs. Andrew B. Anderson)(1865-1908)
2 CONT 5) Abel Thompson (Mar 1868-aft 1920)
2 CONT 6) Carrie Ellen Thompson (Mrs. Henry Stoll)(1869-1935) FAG# 85070272
