1 NOTE {geni:about_me} To America 1854.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/126100862/malena-evenson
2 CONT
2 CONT Malena (aka Maline) Olson married John Evenson. To this union the following children were born:
2 CONT 1) Edward J. Evenson (Apr 1862-1913)
2 CONT 2) Joseph Evenson (1864-1951)
2 CONT 3) Martin J. Evenson (abt 1866-15 Oct 1950)
2 CONT 4) Jorgine Marie Evenson (1867-1873)
2 CONT 5) Alfred Evenson (1870-1874)
2 CONT 6) John Evenson (7 Jan 1872-)
2 CONT 7) Rev. Alfred J. Evenson (8 Mar 1874-22 Jan 1950; burial Sherman, Minnehaha county, South Dakota)
2 CONT 8) Jorgine Marie Evenson #2 (Mrs. Carl J. Johnson) (abt 1877-)
2 CONT
2 CONT Maline and John Evenson were members of the Salem Lutheran Church, Roland, Iowa.
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------------
2 CONT Obituary transcribed by Mark Christian, source: The Nevada Representative, Nevada, Story County, Iowa, Wednesday, December 18, 1878.
2 CONT
2 CONT "Mrs. Evenson, wife of Mr. John Evenson, of Roland, Howard township died on Friday of last week. She leaves a husband and six children, the youngest only two years old, to mourn her loss. The friends of the family, and they are nu
2 CONC merous in Story county, unite in extending their sympathy to the bereaved in the sad hour of their affliction."
