1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Nils came from Sveinunggard, a farm in neighboring Skurdal and Gunhild from the Rotegard farm in Tunnhovd.  They were married April 4, 1808, and lived at Sveinunggard until 1831, when they moved to Lillegard.    Between 1852 and 1
2 CONC 873 all of the Lillegard siblings except Joran came to America, and all of their children.  Five of Joran's children also came, and some of the children of another.  A few in Joran's family remained in Norway, and some of their de
2 CONC scendants still live at Tunnhovd.   In America the immigrants went their separate ways, raised families, and passed on, and during this century there were until 1979 almost no contacts between the different branches of the Lillega
2 CONC rd Clan.         Charles H. Benrud      Aug. 1, 1982
