1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT The second daughter, Joran, married Ole Ellingen Majormoen and they lived at Sonstegard in Tunnhovd.  She did not leave Norway, but all but two of her children followed their aunts, uncles and cousins across the Atlantic, as did a
2 CONC lso four children of one of the two.  The oldest Sonstegard son, Elling, came in 1869 and Sven came in 1871, taking the name "Swen Olson".
