1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mildred F. Bakke, 101, died Tuesday, March 29, 2011 at Oakland Park Communities, Thief River Falls, MN.
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral services were held Saturday, April 2, 2011, at Zion Lutheran Church, Thief River Falls, MN with Reverend John Golv and Rev. Ale Tulu officiating. Casket bearers included DuWayne Bakke, Ronald Bakke, Brett Bakke, Richard Ba
2 CONC kke, Elijah Nelson and Jacob Nelson. Interment was held at Greenwood Cemetery, Thief River Falls, MN.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mildred Bakke was born June 8, 1909, in Thief iver Falls, MN, the daughter of Hans and Jennie (Berg) Jacobson. She attended school in Thief River Falls. Mildred was united in marriage to Alfred Bakke, of Newfolden, MN. July 3, 193
2 CONC 6, in Thief River Falls, where the couple made their home.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her jobs in life were working at Land O'Lakes in Thief River Falls and Arctic Cat in Karlstad, MN, for many years. Mildred and Alfred were bailiffs at the court house for years.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mildred's great jos in life were gardening, handiwork, church activities and baking. Family was a top priority, and very precious always. She also enjoyed playing cards and marbles with her friends.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mildred is survived by her children: DuWayne (Pat) Bakke, Hudson, WI, and Ronald (Karin) Bakke, Coon Rapids; grandchildren: Brett Bakke, Hudson, WI, Richard (Ronas) Bakke, Coon Rapids, and Linda (Dan) Nelson, Maple Lake; great-gra
2 CONC ndchildren, Sarah Bakke, Coon Rapids, Zachary (Stephanie) Nelson, Phoenix, AZ, Heather, Elijah, and Jacob Nelson, Maple Lake; sister, Lorraine Brown, St.Paul; brother, Kermit (Betty) Eastman, Sauk Rapids; and many nieces and nephe
2 CONC ws.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was preceded in death by her husband, Alfred in 1982; parents; step-father, George Eastman; brothers, Joseph, Gordon and Edwin; sister, Alice Eastman, Helen Christensen, Gladys Erickson, Margaret Amren, Violet Jacobson and Kat
2 CONC herine Travnicek.  http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GSln=bakke&GSfn=mildred&GSbyrel=all&GSdyrel=all&GSob=n&GRid=84483314&df=all&
